Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:31.46,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.69,0:02:21.06,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Good morning, Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.69,0:02:22.34,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:28.75,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Was I actually just—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.09,0:02:30.89,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yes, you fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.42,0:02:34.00,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Though only for about five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.89,0:02:37.86,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.56,0:02:47.52,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,Reine's laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:52.77,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,This is the first time I've heard \NAnalyst Murasame laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.29,0:02:54.74,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.74,0:02:56.07,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I did, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:03:00.23,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Well then, I've lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.84,0:03:06.43,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,U-Um, what's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.15,0:03:08.62,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.05,0:03:12.04,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It's been a long time \Nsince I fell into a pleasant sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.06,0:03:16.92,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Your shoulder must have been quite comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.23,0:03:18.92,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:22.55,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,There's a fluctuation in Reine's \Naffection and mental state!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.90,0:03:23.68,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.38,0:03:26.43,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:29.68,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Hmm? Why are you looking serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.06,0:03:31.14,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.78,0:03:34.54,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,you mentioned having someone you loved,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.39,0:03:39.07,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,but could I be that man?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.20,0:03:44.44,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I know I'll never be a replacement for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.44,0:03:51.33,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But would you let me love you in \Nmy own way that's different from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.37,0:03:56.38,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Reine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.57,0:04:06.02,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Shin, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.74,0:04:15.85,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.17,0:04:23.88,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,Commander!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:25.11,Main,Nakatsugawa,0,0,0,,These numbers are abnormal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.11,0:04:26.12,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.17,0:04:38.38,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Her spirit power isn't flowing into me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.82,0:04:48.89,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I see. You've seen the future, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:52.23,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,What are you so surprised for?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:56.01,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It's possible to share memories \Nonce a pass is formed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:59.40,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It's not your first time \Nexperiencing it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.03,0:05:02.42,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Now I've solved the mystery behind today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.90,0:05:07.03,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,No, I think I might have vaguely sensed it,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.03,0:05:09.27,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,but I imagine I didn't want to understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.37,0:05:14.78,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Because I was very happy \Nwhen you invited me on a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:17.83,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I really did have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:23.22,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,So much so that I was able to forget \Nmy harsh past for a short time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:27.61,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Though all dreams must come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.17,0:05:29.25,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Isn't that right,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.93,0:05:31.83,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Shido?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:36.96,Main - Italics,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido! It's DEM!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.96,0:05:37.69,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.59,0:05:49.51,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It would seem history's been rewritten.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:55.62,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Would you return to Fraxinus with me, Reine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.28,0:05:57.88,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,After we defeat DEM,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.88,0:06:01.30,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,you could live together with me \Nand all the other Spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.73,0:06:03.86,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm sure every day would be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.37,0:06:07.71,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Yes, that's a very attractive offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.90,0:06:13.91,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I'm sure I would've taken it up without \Na second thought if I hadn't met Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:15.35,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Then—!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.35,0:06:16.72,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.35,0:06:19.74,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Because I did meet Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.67,0:06:24.97,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,It's a genuine fact that \NI love all the Spirits too,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.97,0:06:30.41,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,but I'm willing to throw away everything \Nif it means reuniting with Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.75,0:06:44.88,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.88,0:06:46.13,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.43,0:06:50.90,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,"Why?" is quite the greeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.90,0:06:54.89,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Especially when I came running to your aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:56.53,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Kurumi, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.53,0:06:58.32,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I'm glad you came.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.32,0:07:00.64,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Having you here makes things quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:06.59,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,My, my, you're as arrogant \Nand intolerable as ever,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:08.65,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Spirit of Origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:13.54,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I can't believe I let you completely fool me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.54,0:07:18.16,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I never even imagined \Nmy bitter enemy would be so close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.58,0:07:20.14,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Either way,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.14,0:07:25.17,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,this means the remaining two Sephirah \Npossessed by you and Westcott
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.17,0:07:27.31,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,have been gathered here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.10,0:07:30.92,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,That's enough to awaken Shin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.24,0:07:35.09,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Well now, I wonder \Nif it will go that easily for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.98,0:07:55.22,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,I'm taking them back, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.71,0:07:59.54,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Both the Sephirah inside you, \Nand my other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.91,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Hah! I refuse to let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.50,0:08:10.76,Main,Reine,0,0,0,,Come to me, Kurumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.69,0:08:18.74,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.62,0:08:26.43,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,I've been waiting for this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:31.01,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Zaphkiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.34,0:08:38.28,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kurumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:14.86,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mio.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.34,0:09:17.93,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It's been a long time since you've\Nseen me in this form.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.64,0:09:25.62,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,No, you've already met me in this form \Nin a future I don't know of, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:27.62,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That's a bit complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.69,0:09:36.13,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,You don't have Kurumi's Sephirah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.79,0:09:39.81,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,That girl must have done something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.25,0:09:43.64,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Leave it to my dear best friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.54,0:09:53.78,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:00.95,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Are these?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:02.95,Main,Shizaki,0,0,0,,DEM warships approaching!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.29,0:10:05.45,Main,Kishimoto,0,0,0,,They'll be entering firing range at any moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.45,0:10:07.53,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido, we're retrieving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.53,0:10:09.58,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Then we're taking a moment to regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:12.59,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:13.59,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Shin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.10,0:10:20.86,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,He was taken back by Fraxinus?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.07,0:10:24.97,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,I suppose that might be \Nthe safest place for him right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:30.57,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,It wouldn't be very nice if those crude wizards
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.98,0:10:34.55,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,and automatons destroyed this scenery.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.23,0:10:36.74,Main,Mio,0,0,0,,Ein Sof Ohr!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.17,0:10:42.78,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:43.49,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,-Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:43.49,Main,Miku,0,0,0,,-Darling!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:43.49,Main,Nia,0,0,0,,-Boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:43.49,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,-Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.05,0:10:47.00,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Tohka, everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:48.84,Main,Yoshino,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.84,0:10:50.75,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Did Mio do anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.02,0:10:56.38,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,No, though I was a little confused from \NMio's memories flooding into me all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.38,0:10:57.81,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:10:59.45,Main,Kishimoto,0,0,0,,Commander, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:08.02,Main,Minowa,0,0,0,,So that's Ein Sof Ohr?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.37,0:11:11.02,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,The Spirit of Origin's Angel...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:14.52,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,I had heard about it, \Nbut I didn't realize it was that powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.81,0:11:18.65,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Let's fall back while DEM \Nis keeping Mio occupied.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:19.61,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.89,0:11:20.72,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.72,0:11:21.77,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,We can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.77,0:11:23.37,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,I can't run away yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.93,0:11:25.38,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:26.84,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Our operation has failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.84,0:11:29.87,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,We need to withdraw and think of our next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.69,0:11:35.00,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,Someone is seeking communication with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.00,0:11:36.88,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,What shall I do, Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.41,0:11:40.63,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,All right, put them through.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.88,0:11:44.51,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Shido! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.77,0:11:47.85,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Huh? The school?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.41,0:11:49.73,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.50,0:11:54.48,Main,Origami,0,0,0,,Captain, Mike, and Milly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:58.01,Main,Kaguya,0,0,0,,Yuzuru, that's...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.01,0:12:01.11,Main,Yuzuru,0,0,0,,Astonishment. That's our classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.54,0:12:03.61,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.14,0:12:15.75,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Is it a terrorist?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:17.25,Main,Tama,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.23,0:12:25.76,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,It's exactly as you see, members of Ratatoskr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.14,0:12:27.76,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Westcott!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.81,0:12:31.50,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,It's good to do things \Nlike this now and then, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.50,0:12:33.61,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Now that Deus has manifested,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.61,0:12:37.15,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,I'd like to finish up our business \Nas quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:39.65,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Are you threatening us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.65,0:12:42.78,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,There's no deal to be had here though.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.18,0:12:47.90,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,If we hand the Sephirah over to you, \Nyou'll just overwrite the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.90,0:12:49.79,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,That would defeat the entire point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:56.37,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Then I'll simply murder those girls \Nas brutally as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.38,0:13:03.30,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,If even one Spirit inverts, \Nthen that's enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.56,0:13:19.08,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.08,0:13:22.22,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,Design-wise, these aren't \Nheroes of justice, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:24.90,Main,Mai,0,0,0,,They're more like minions of evil, if anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:26.31,Main,Mii,0,0,0,,That's so lame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.39,0:13:28.98,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.98,0:13:35.53,Main,Tonomachi,0,0,0,,I wanted to bury my face in a woman's \Nthighs at least once before I died!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.53,0:13:38.53,Main,Tama,0,0,0,,E-Everyone, please hurry up and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.53,0:13:40.88,Main,Ai,0,0,0,,We're already surrounded, though!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:50.05,Main,Tama,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.86,0:13:58.22,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Ai, Mai, Mii?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.22,0:14:00.15,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Also, Tonomachi and Tama.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:02.81,Main,Three,0,0,0,,Tohka?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.81,0:14:03.96,Main,Tama,0,0,0,,Yatogami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.96,0:14:05.03,Main,Mii,0,0,0,,That's so lame!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.40,0:14:08.03,Main,Tohka,0,0,0,,Everyone, stick together in one spot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.41,0:14:32.22,Main,Ryoko,0,0,0,,O-Origami?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.12,0:14:45.11,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.61,0:14:48.85,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Hmm, it looks like everyone made it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.85,0:14:51.31,Main,Mukuro,0,0,0,,Though I was worried \Nabout long-distance transit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.62,0:14:57.25,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Oh, god, will we be able to cover \Nall this up, even with Ratatoskr's power?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.25,0:14:59.12,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,My stomach is already upset at the thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.49,0:15:00.37,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.69,0:15:04.38,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Still, we weathered that, Isaac Westcott!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:07.33,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,That truly was a brilliant showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.33,0:15:11.26,Main - Italics,Westcott,0,0,0,,Though one always keeps \Ntheir trump card in reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.69,0:15:13.09,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.13,0:15:19.21,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,A DEM warship has rammed Fraxinus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.21,0:15:23.42,Main - Italics,Maria,0,0,0,,It appears to be synchronizing \Nits territory and docking with ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.20,0:15:27.90,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Goetia! Ellen Mathers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.62,0:15:36.18,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,It's delusional to think \Nyou're safe inside your warship.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:39.06,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,At least it is when facing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:52.32,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,One always keeps their trump card in reserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.32,0:15:55.93,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,That certainly is a nice phrase, \Ncoming from a brutish president.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.34,0:15:57.43,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.60,0:16:05.27,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido, that's reckless!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.76,0:16:09.40,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Mana!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.34,0:16:19.09,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,My, my, the siblings all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.09,0:16:21.17,Main,Nibelcoole,0,0,0,,Would you let me join in too?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.83,0:16:24.92,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Nibeelcole!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:32.67,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Westcott!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:36.93,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,What's happening to the DEM warships?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.18,0:16:39.31,Main,Kawagoe,0,0,0,,They're under attack from Ein Sof Ohr!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.31,0:16:42.06,Main,Nakatsugawa,0,0,0,,Several ships have suffered major damage \Nand their formation is in disarray!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.38,0:16:47.97,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,He's targeting Shido while the warships \Nare drawing Mio Takamiya's attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.61,0:16:51.50,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's willing \Nto use entire warships as bait...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.50,0:16:53.32,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,That's a bold move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.32,0:16:55.70,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,This is no time to be impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.06,0:16:58.45,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I'm leaving the bridge to you, Kannazuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:16:59.38,Main,Kannazuki,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:04.19,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:11.37,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Here's some nostalgic faces all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.37,0:17:14.59,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,It feels like I've gone back into the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.90,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.90,0:17:20.26,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Neither you nor Ellen have moved on since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.26,0:17:25.10,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Though normally one would show \Nat least some growth after all this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.50,0:17:29.85,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Honestly, I would love to \Nreminisce about old times,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.85,0:17:32.46,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,but unfortunately I'm short on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.89,0:17:37.49,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,I'll be finishing this \Nbefore your Spirits return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.10,0:17:41.94,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Tsk!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.94,0:17:45.26,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,If you're talking about \Nsiblings being together,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.26,0:17:47.51,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,then aren't you forgetting one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:50.51,Main,Both,0,0,0,,Kotori!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.91,0:17:52.64,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,There's no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.64,0:17:56.81,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Mukuro needs to maintain the portals \Nso everyone can return,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.81,0:17:59.71,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,and Nia doesn't have the power left to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.14,0:18:02.64,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,That means I'm the only one left.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.97,0:18:04.30,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,But still...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:05.68,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:10.14,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,I can wield my power for a bit before getting \Noverwhelmed by my destructive impulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.14,0:18:13.78,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,It would be a bad joke if I couldn't do \Nanything during an emergency like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.21,0:18:15.26,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Kotori...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:16.53,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Kotori...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.77,0:18:21.16,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Sandalphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.08,0:18:24.16,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Wolftail!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.01,0:18:26.91,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Camael!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.21,0:18:36.17,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Here we come, Isaac Westcott!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.17,0:18:40.10,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,We'll show you the combined might \Nof us three siblings!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:41.55,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Right, Kotori?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.88,0:18:44.68,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Are we really three siblings?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.97,0:18:47.53,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,This isn't the time for nitpicking details.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.42,0:18:54.81,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.81,0:18:58.70,Main,Westcott,0,0,0,,Try and fight your fate, humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:13.67,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,We'll soon arrive at the battlefield, Elliot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.27,0:19:17.81,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Deus...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.81,0:19:19.18,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Mio, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:24.15,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,It's the Spirit we all summoned \Nthirty years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.98,0:19:27.45,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,In order to get revenge on mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.22,0:19:33.14,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Good grief, I fell for quite the evil woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.90,0:19:43.32,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Though if Deus is going to fight the other \NSpirits, then I can't leave her alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.23,0:19:45.72,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Which should we protect?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.72,0:19:48.38,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,That's obvious. Both.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.87,0:19:50.19,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Both?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:53.02,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,Do you think that's even possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:56.09,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,It would be impossible on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.09,0:19:58.84,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,But that boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.58,0:20:05.66,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Shido Itsuka should be \Nthinking the same thing I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.51,0:20:09.79,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,So you're going then, Elliot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.29,0:20:11.51,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:14.48,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Karen, I'm counting on you to prepare Wodan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.34,0:20:22.11,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Do you find it hard to believe \Nthat the man who betrayed his allies
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.58,0:20:28.26,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,in order to protect a Spirit \Nwould risk his life to fulfill that duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.07,0:20:33.61,Main,Karen,0,0,0,,I've followed you this far \Nprecisely because you're like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:42.22,Main,Woodman,0,0,0,,Please, Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.51,0:20:46.13,Main - Italics,Crew,0,0,0,,Sir Woodman, we're awaiting your orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.71,0:20:48.51,Main - Italics,Crew,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.86,0:20:50.18,Main - Italics,Crew,0,0,0,,This response is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:20:58.90,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:20:58.90,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:01.36,Main,Kotori,0,0,0,,Shido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.36,0:21:02.15,Main,Mana,0,0,0,,Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.30,0:21:14.54,Main,Ellen,0,0,0,,Now, this is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.85,0:21:18.29,Main,Shido,0,0,0,,Dammit! It can't end here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.09,0:21:50.41,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Now then, it's finally time \Nto repay that favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:54.95,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.333,185.466)}Episode 10
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.91,0:21:54.95,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\an8\b1\fs20\shad1\blur1\bord1\c&H000000&\3c&HADB0AD&\4c&HADB0AD&\pos(317.866,280.399)}A Battlefield That Shouldn't Be Possible
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:53.73,Main,Kurumi,0,0,0,,Shido.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.96,0:23:39.98,Main,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an3\fnTimes New Roman\bord1\blur3\shad1\fs20\pos(604,310)\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H3D3D3D&\shad0\3a&H60&}Episode 11: {\fscx80}"A Fleeting Paradise"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.08,0:23:29.02,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Everyone has a summer they'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.47,0:23:33.21,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Next time is Episode 11: A Fleeting Paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.72,0:23:35.60,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,"If only I could regain that happiness."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.06,0:23:39.13,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Is it really a sin to wish for that?
